<title>PORTUGAL: J.Martins to announce H1 results end-Aug.</title>
<headline>J.Martins to announce H1 results end-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese retailer Estabelecimentos Jeronimo Martins &amp; Filho-SGPS is expected to release first-half results in the last week of August, a company official said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
